<Layout
  title="Careers | Toile Blanche"
  description="Do you think you have the skills and passion necessary to contribute to the success of Toile Blanche? Learn more."
  ogImage="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/639af6c370637a9be3e3b0b0/63dbc14a7fa59e1233dd4d93_Neutral%20Beige%20Minimalist%20Photo%20Collage%20Facebook%20Cover%20(1).jpg"
>
  <Nav theme="both" />

  <div class="section bottom-padding-192 no-top-padding"><div class="container"><div class="hero4" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0"><div class="subtitle">Careers</div><h1>The TEAM</h1><div class="hero-arrow"><img alt="arrow down" class="hero-arrow-image" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-1e6e73d27d5690.svg" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)"/></div></div></div></div><div class="section no-top-padding"><div class="container"><div class="paragraph-width-medium"><p>Toile Blanche is more than just a place to work. It's a place where you can turn your passion for hospitality into a career that you love. Here are some reasons why joining the Toile Blanche team is a great decision for anyone who wants to grow and succeed in the industry:<br/><br/>Opportunities for growth: At Toile Blanche, you will have access to opportunities for growth and advancement within the company. Our team is dedicated to helping you develop your skills and reach your full potential.<br/><br/>A supportive and inclusive environment: We believe that a positive work environment is key to success, and we strive to create a supportive and inclusive atmosphere for all team members. You'll feel valued and respected, no matter what your role is.<br/><br/>A commitment to excellence: At Toile Blanche, we are dedicated to providing our guests with exceptional service. This commitment to excellence extends to our team members as well, and you can expect to work with the best in the business.<br/><br/>A chance to make a difference: Your work at Toile Blanche will have a real impact on the lives of others. Whether you're serving a delicious meal, creating a comfortable room, or helping guests plan their itinerary, you'll be making a difference every day.<br/><br/>A dynamic and exciting industry: Hospitality is a fast-paced and ever-evolving industry, and working at Toile Blanche will keep you at the forefront of these changes. You'll have the chance to work with new technologies, meet interesting people, and explore new destinations.<br/><br/>Joining the Toile Blanche team is an opportunity to turn your passion for hospitality into a fulfilling and rewarding career. So why wait? Apply today and become a part of something special!</p><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button w-button" href="nullnicolas@toileblanche.com">Apply Now!</a></div></div></div></div><div><div class="full-frame-image-wrapper careers"><div class="full-frame-image-content"><p class="light">The streets of Mexico</p></div></div></div><div class="divider _96px"></div><div class="section bg-color-2 hide"><div class="container"><div class="cta-wrapper"><div class="w-layout-grid cta-3-grid"><div class="cta-area-1" id="w-node-a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af06-f049af02"><p>Get our emails. News about Toile Blanche, offers, special dishes from the chef’s table and much more. Not too often — Just enough.</p></div><div class="cta-area-2" id="w-node-a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af09-f049af02"><h3>Don't be a stranger!</h3></div><div class="cta-area-3" id="w-node-a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af0c-f049af02"><div class="newsletter-form-block w-form"><form class="newsletter-form" data-name="Newsletter Form" data-wf-element-id="a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af0e" data-wf-page-id="63e6418f0002fca13daffd2f" id="wf-form-Newsletter-Form" method="get" name="wf-form-Newsletter-Form"><div class="newsletter-input"><label for="Full-Name">Name</label><input class="form-input w-input" data-name="Full Name" id="Full-Name" maxlength="256" name="Full-Name" placeholder="John Doe" required="" type="text"/></div><div class="newsletter-input"><label for="Email">Email Address</label><input class="form-input w-input" data-name="Email" id="Email" maxlength="256" name="Email" placeholder="john.doe@myemail.com" required="" type="email"/></div><input class="submit-button w-button" data-wait="Please wait..." type="submit" value="Try it out now!"/></form><div class="w-form-done"><div>Thank you! Your submission has been received!</div></div><div class="w-form-fail"><div>Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.</div></div></div><div class="small-text">*By subscribing to our newsletter you agree to our Privacy Policy</div></div></div></div></div></div>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
